title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/kmtmedia.jpg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our newspapers and radio.

= Media

The KMT's new leninist organization allows us to spread propaganda further among the chinese people.

- @commercial
- @campaign
- @ideological
- @newspaper
- @newspaper_2
- @newspaper_3
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@commercial
title: Make our newspapers more commercialized by broadening their appeal beyond party supporters.
subtitle: This might upset ideological purists, but it may bring in more funds and perhaps expose the middle class to our views.
on-arrival: resources += 1; commercialized_media += 1; new_middle_kmt += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_kmt += 3*(1-dissent); left_dissent += 8; center_left_dissent += 8; center_dissent += 5

Our commercialized newspapers are able to bring in more funds. However, the left and center express their disagreement.

@campaign
title: The purpose of our media is to spread our cause.
subtitle: -1 - Our newspapers will focus on educating the peasants about our goals.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; rural_kmt += 5*(1 - dissent); workers_kmt += 4*(1 - dissent); unemployed_kmt += 3*(1-dissent);

Our campaign media is teaching the labourers and the illiterate peasants about our beliefs and goals, which resonate well with them.

@ideological
title: We will have vibrant ideological debate.
subtitle: There will be space for all factions to air their views.
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 5; center_left_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 5; right_dissent -= 5;

This is a pretty new idea, but it might solve some tensions within our party.

@newspaper
title: Why not build a party newspaper?
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: paper = 0
on-arrival: paper += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_kmt += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_kmt += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_kmt += 2*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)

We have founded the Central Daily News, to spread our messages better to the public. We are aware that much in China cannot read, so only the urban workers and middle class get swayed by this.

@newspaper_2
title: We must keep on building up our newspaper.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 0 and radio <= 3
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_kmt += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_kmt += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_kmt += 3*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)

Our new newspaper has a mix of popular and political programming, and is proving a success.

@newspaper_3
title: We must keep on building up our newspaper.
subtitle: It is now financially self-sufficient, and does not require any more resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and radio <= 5 and year <= 1931
on-arrival: radio += 1; new_middle_kmt += 6*(1 - dissent); old_middle_kmt += 5*(1 - dissent); workers_kmt += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_kmt += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_kmt += 2*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)

Our newspapers have become a successful tool for spreading our message.
